 1. moving runners / stationary runner
    status:      exact formulation
    atom:        relative speed v_i
    certificate: exists t with all ||v_i t|| >= 1/(k+1)
    tournament:  choose a distinguished vertex and measure all comparisons relative to it
    sources:     Wills/Cusick/Goddyn, THM-357

 2. simultaneous Diophantine approximation
    status:      exact formulation
    atom:        integer vector v
    certificate: max_t min_i ||v_i t|| >= 1/(k+1)
    tournament:  score/height functional on a labelled complete decision vector
    sources:     Cambridge finite-checking intro, THM-369

 3. forbidden interval cover on R/Z
    status:      exact formulation
    atom:        open interval ||v t|| < 1/n
    certificate: union fails to be the whole circle
    tournament:  good-cut coverage: an uncovered cut is a witness
    sources:     THM-357, HYP-1855

 4. endpoint-protection hypergraph
    status:      exact finite certificate
